  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "type": "table",
   "title": "HorizonDB 쿼리 유형별 시간",
   "description": "SQL 앞부분으로 묶은 쿼리별 호출 수, 평균, p95. AGE cypher와 벡터(<=>) 쿼리를 먼저, 나머지는 호출 수 순으로 보여 줍니다.",
   "datasource": {
    "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource",
    "uid": "${datasource}"
   },
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 10,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 24
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "grafana-azure-monitor-datasource",
      "uid": "${datasource}"
     },
     "queryType": "Azure Log Analytics",
     "azureLogAnalytics": {
      "query": "dependencies\n| where $__timeFilter(timestamp)\n| where cloud_RoleName == ${role:singlequote}\n| where type == \"postgresql\"\n| extend query_kind = case(data has \"ag_catalog.cypher\", \"AGE cypher\", data has \"<=>\", \"vector <=>\", \"other\")\n| extend statement = substring(replace_regex(data, @\"\\s+\", \" \"), 0, 120)\n| summarize calls = count(), avg_ms = round(avg(duration), 1), p95_ms = round(percentile(duration, 95), 1) by query_kind, statement\n| order by iff(query_kind == \"other\", 1, 0) asc, calls desc\n| take 15",
      "resources": [
       "$appinsights"
      ],
      "resultFormat": "table"
     }
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "short"
    },
    "overrides": []
   },
   "options": {
    "showHeader": true,
    "cellHeight": "sm"
   }
  },
